## 2. Cloud Architecture Design

### 2.1 System Architecture

```
                    Customer
                        │
                        │
                  HTTP Request
                        │
                        ▼
              Google Cloud Load Balancer
                        │
                        ▼
              Compute Engine Instance
                (CloudMart Server)
                        │
        ┌───────────────┼────────────────┐
        │               │                │
        ▼               ▼                ▼
   Firestore      Cloud Storage    Cloud Monitoring
 (Database)      (Product Images)   (Performance)
```

---

### 2.2 Architecture Description

The CloudMart Server architecture follows a cloud-native deployment model where user requests are routed through a Google Cloud Load Balancer before reaching the Compute Engine virtual machine hosting the Flask web application.

Application data including products, users, shopping carts, and orders are stored in Google Firestore, while product images are stored in Google Cloud Storage. Cloud Monitoring is used to monitor virtual machine performance and resource utilization.

---

### 2.3 Google Cloud Services Used

| Google Cloud Service        | Purpose                            |
| --------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |
| Compute Engine              | Hosts the Flask web application    |
| Firestore                   | Stores products, users, and orders |
| Cloud Storage               | Stores product images              |
| Cloud Load Balancing        | Distributes incoming traffic       |
| Virtual Private Cloud (VPC) | Secure network isolation           |
| Firewall Rules              | Network protection                 |
| IAM                         | User role management               |
| Cloud Monitoring            | Performance monitoring             |

---

### 2.4 Deployment Model

The project follows a public cloud deployment model where the application is hosted entirely on Google Cloud Platform.

Deployment consists of:

* Compute Engine virtual machine
* Firestore NoSQL database
* Cloud Storage bucket
* External Load Balancer
* Custom VPC network
* Firewall configuration

